flowchart TD
    START([Start
    targetDevice IP and showCommand CSV]) --> A

    A["Step 1 - Get Devices
    GET /api/v1/network-device
    -> DeviceInventory"] --> B

    B["Step 2 - Find Device
    JSONPath:
    $.response[?(@.managementIpAddress==targetDevice)].instanceUuid
    -> DeviceUUID"] --> C

    C["Step 3 - String to Array (atomic)
    showCommand string -> showCommands array"] --> D

    D["Step 4 - Set Variables
    targetDevices = [DeviceUUID]"] --> E

    E{Step 5 -<br/>0 < commands <= 5?}
    E -->|No| FAIL([Fail: invalid command count])
    E -->|Yes| F

    subgraph CMDRUN["Command Runner inner sequence"]
        direction TB
        F["POST /dna/intent/api/v1/network-device-poller/cli/read-request
        body: deviceUuids + commands"] --> G
        G["Wait For Catalyst Center Task (atomic)
        polls /task/{taskId}"] --> H
        H["Extract fileId from task.progress"] --> I
        I["GET /dna/intent/api/v1/file/{fileId}
        -> Results (string)"]
    end

    I --> J
    J["Publish outputs
    Results, Device UUID Output,
    DeviceInventoryOutput, Device List Output"] --> END([End])
